## Day 4 — Dataset Evaluation and Primary-Source Selection

### Completed

- Established dataset-selection criteria for asset-level physical-risk screening.
- Distinguished historical coverage from asset relevance.
- Evaluated candidate extreme-heat datasets.
- Selected ERA5-Land as the primary heat-hazard candidate.
- Retained IMD gridded temperature as the observational benchmark.
- Evaluated candidate extreme-precipitation datasets.
- Selected NASA GPM IMERG V07B as the primary precipitation-hazard candidate.
